om 0 to 0 do\nfor i2  from 0 to N1-i1 do\nfor i3  from 0 to N1-i1-i2 d
o\nfor i4  from 0 to N1-i1-i2-i3 do\nfor i5  from 0 to N1-i1-i2-i3-i4 \+
