-i3-i4-i5-i6 do\nfor i8  from 0 to N1-i1-i2-i3-i4-i5-i6-i7 do\nfor i9 \+
 from 0 to N1-i1-i2-i3-i4-i5-i6-i7-i8 do\nfor i10 from 0 to N1-i1-i2-i
