r i2  from 0 to N1-i1 do\nfor i3  from 0 to N1-i1-i2 do\nfor i4  from \+
0 to N1-i1-i2-i3 do\nfor i5  from 0 to N1-i1-i2-i3-i4 do\nfor i6  from
 0 to N1-i1-i2-i3-i4-i5 do\nfor i7  from 0 to N1-i1-i2-i3-i4-i5-i6 do
\nfor i8  from 0 to N1-i1-i2-i3-i4-i5-i6-i7 do\nfor i9  from 0 to N1-i
