to N1-i1-i2-i3-i4-i5-i6-i7-i8-i9-i10-i11-i12 do\nfor i14 from 0 to N1-
i1-i2-i3-i4-i5-i6-i7-i8-i9-i10-i11-i12-i13 do\nfor i15 from 0 to N1-i1
